      "message": "test(app): the program follows creation order; the setup sheet says \"position\"\n\nremachining's order test pinned the name-order wart #167 retires\n(\"Operation10\" ran before \"Operation2\" made first); it now pins the\nreverse - creation order runs, the op generated against an empty\nprogram goes Stale naming the op ahead, and Regenerate All masks it.\nThe setup sheet's order test reorders explicitly to keep \"the sheet\nfollows the post, not history\", and its header reads \"setup rank,\nthen position\".\n\nRefs #167\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
